text = "Hi!! Thanks for playing my game and sorry for such a long wall of text :(

The little flying star guys are the Ziooteks. They are helping you get through the levels!

If you're on the ground and move, the Ziooteks will move with you, but if you're in the air, they won't move horizontally,
instead, they will move vertically when you press up/down.

If you're directly above or below a Ziootek, it will move slower.

The animations aren't very polished because I didn't have enough time, sorry ):"
